OL,3,GNEWSANew bovine TB strategy 'could
OL,4,Achange everything'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cattle vet who has studied bovine
OL,7,Ftuberculosis (TB) for more than two
OL,8,Fdecades says the government's new
OL,9,Fstrategy aimed at eradicating the
OL,10,Fdisease in England by 2038 is "amazing
OL,11,Fnews".
OL,13,FThe new multi-faceted approach includes
OL,14,Fdeveloping vaccines for cattle and
OL,15,Fbadgers, mandatory blood tests, more
OL,16,Frobust wildlife surveillance and more
OL,17,Ftest choice. The controversial culling
OL,18,Fof badgers to prevent the spread of TB
OL,19,Fto cattle was ended by the government
OL,20,Flast year.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
PN,34802
SC,0002
