PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1793897781
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSANew bovine TB strategy 'could
OL,4,Achange everything'
OL,5,
OL,6,FKeith Cutler, who practices in Somerset
OL,7,Fand Dorset, said the new strategy
OL,8,F"could change everything".
OL,10,FBut Liberal Democrat MP for Glastonbury
OL,11,Fand Somerton Sarah Dyke, who has a
OL,12,Ffamily farm, said: "Farmers need action
OL,13,Fnow, not in 2038."
